  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Alone after Hu Mei Er leaves, Li Xian privately expects that after Sky Tiger Xue San Si’s death he will leave Gu refinement seclusion when the three kings inheritance opens on San Cha Mountain and most likely find trouble for the black and white twin demons.",
      "chapters": [
        344
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hu_mei_er",
        "char_li_xian",
        "char_xue_san_si",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan treats him as a strength path Gu Master and as Xue San Si’s patron, and expects a reckoning once the inheritance closes.",
      "chapters": [
        345
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "path_strength",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a boy wearing black clothes.",
      "chapters": [
        345
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He wears a black robe and looks like a tender boy. His body and appearance are fixed to a child’s physique.",
      "chapters": [
        367
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cave",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Yi Huo warns Fang Yuan that Xue San Si was Century Boy’s goddaughter, that Century Boy has been watching him, and that Century Boy is a wood path Gu Master at rank four upper stage and a thorny character of the demonic path.",
      "chapters": [
        355
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path-and-warning",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yi_huo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources conflict:",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path-and-warning",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is open.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path-and-warning",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Months later he hosts a banquet in a San Cha Mountain cave. He looks like a tender boy in a black robe but is over a hundred and eighty years old, using return to childhood Gu to stretch lifespan at the cost of a fixed child physique. He is called part of the senior generation of the demonic path, known for guiding newcomers, and has gathered many godsons and goddaughters into a sizable force. Guests include Rock Lizard Li Qiang and Fiery Star Bao Tong. After Fang Yuan killed Xue San Si he had proclaimed revenge, then went quiet after Tie Ba Xiu’s death. Li Qiang reminds him he is also strength path; Fang Yuan arrives outside, names him strength path, and demands he come out to exchange moves.",
      "chapters": [
        367
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "banquet",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_return_to_childhood_gu",
        "char_li_qiang",
        "char_bao_tong",
        "char_tie_ba_xiu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He walks out rather than ruin years of reputation by refusing in public. Outside the cave the fight is framed as two strength path Gu Masters at close range. Fang Yuan’s beast phantoms press him until he tries to retreat toward the cave. Bai Ning Bing blocks the path, Fang Yuan tears him in half, and his corpse is left on the ground while Fang Yuan takes the host seat and occupies the cave.",
      "chapters": [
        368
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cave-front-exchange",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    }
  ],
